python-uvicorn (0.51.0-1~vitex1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Packaged to provide a newer uvicorn than Debian trixie's own
    python3-uvicorn 0.32.0-3, needed for the
    uvicorn.protocols.websockets.websockets_sansio_impl module
    required by fastmcp's HTTP transport (available from uvicorn
    >= 0.34).

